# PSR-4b-configure-3b — product-named configure ceiling → 0

## Prerequisite

[`psr-4b-configure-3.mdoc`](./psr-4b-configure-3.mdoc) already moved `/host/*`
imports behind `workspace-product-http-host-bindings.generated.ts`. Isolation was
GREEN; product-named count was still **2**.

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Extract Urban exposure → `exposure/resolve-urban-surface-exposure.ts` | Yes |
| Share tour-store resolver → `http/resolve-product-tour-store.ts` | Yes |
| Merge denali+urban wiring → `configure-product-http-hosts.ts` | Yes |
| Classify product wire as `platform-neutral` (zero branded package imports) | Yes |
| Delete `configure-workspace-denali-product-http-host.ts` | Yes |
| Delete `configure-urban-http-host.ts` | Yes |
| Retarget app.ts / contracts / m17 / marketing-guard | Yes |
| Ratchet product-named ceiling **2→0** | Yes |
| Stuff full wiring into codegen template | **No** — hand-written neutral adapter is enough |

Land commit: `7305b210`

## Why this is still SoT-faithful

SoT §PSR-4.4: *product-named* configure modules leave the host; branded imports
live in generated loaders (or approved adapters).

After this wave:

| Path | Class | Branded `@app-tour/workspace-*` |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `configure-finance-http-host.ts` | platform-neutral | none (`@app-tour/finance-http`) |
| `configure-product-http-hosts.ts` | platform-neutral | none (types/configure via `*.generated.ts` only) |
| `workspace-product-http-host-bindings.generated.ts` | generated | `/host/http` |
| `resolve-urban-surface-exposure.ts` | host exposure | none (via exposure generated bindings) |

## Boot path

```text
app.ts
  → configure-product-http-hosts.ts   (side-effect: denali + urban)
  → configure-finance-http-host.ts
configure-product-http-hosts.ts
  → workspace-product-http-host-bindings.generated.ts
  → resolve-urban-surface-exposure / resolve-denali-surface-exposure
  → resolve-product-tour-store
```

## Ratchet

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-configure-smoke.mjs
node scripts/guards/guard-api-workspace-isolation.mjs
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-api-neutrality-smoke.mjs
```

| Metric | Ceiling |
| --- | ---: |
| product-named configure files | **0** |
| configure-*.ts file count | **2** |
| bare `/http` in configure | **0** |
| direct `/host/*` in configure | **0** |

## Explicit non-goals

- Moving port wiring into the codegen emitter body
- Renaming finance configure again
- Harbor product HTTP host
